WEBVTT

00:19.640 --> 00:21.480
-[sticks tapping]
-[Hann] One, two, three, four.

00:21.560 --> 00:25.640
-[drum playing]
-[Students] ♪ Hip, hip, hip hippo ♪

00:25.720 --> 00:27.560
[Jer] Oh my god!

00:27.640 --> 00:29.160
He's the real deal.

00:29.240 --> 00:30.440
Yo, yo!

00:30.520 --> 00:34.120
Hann is tolerating his evil fans.

00:34.200 --> 00:35.280
[Students] ♪ Hippo ♪

00:35.360 --> 00:37.840
[Jer] This is our school's
welcoming ceremony.

00:37.920 --> 00:39.560
Be careful.

00:39.640 --> 00:42.560
Who will be our next hippopotamus?

00:42.640 --> 00:44.360
-[cheering]
-Go!

00:44.440 --> 00:45.360
[Students] Hippo, hippo

00:45.440 --> 00:47.520
[Jer] Ha ha. She's for real.

00:47.600 --> 00:49.800
[students singing]

00:49.880 --> 00:52.280
Look at Hann's face. Oh, my god.

00:52.360 --> 00:53.600
[Jer laughing]

00:53.680 --> 00:54.520
♪ Hippo, hippo ♪

00:54.600 --> 00:57.400
[Jer] The newbies are having fun
right now.

00:57.480 --> 01:00.160
[students singing]

01:00.240 --> 01:01.600
What's her name?

01:04.200 --> 01:05.120
[Top] What?

01:09.480 --> 01:11.320
It's all right.

01:11.400 --> 01:12.600
-[girl giggling]
-[Jer] Whoa!

01:12.680 --> 01:13.800
-[Nanno] Hip…
-Hip…

01:13.880 --> 01:15.600
[Jer] Hip… Oh my god.

01:15.680 --> 01:17.480
She's cute.

01:17.560 --> 01:19.880
[chuckling]
Hann is having so much fun.

01:19.960 --> 01:21.560
Things are getting crazier.

01:21.640 --> 01:23.200
-What a fun day!
-Hip

01:26.680 --> 01:29.000
[theme music]

02:38.600 --> 02:40.120
[Nanno] Thank you so much.

02:40.200 --> 02:41.400
Without your help,

02:41.480 --> 02:43.560
it would have been a disaster.

02:43.640 --> 02:44.800
[Hann] You're welcome.

02:44.880 --> 02:47.160
[Jer] Oh. Hey there, you guys.

02:47.240 --> 02:48.360
Hey there.

02:48.440 --> 02:50.360
Do you two know each other?

02:51.200 --> 02:52.520
Uh… No, we do not.

02:52.600 --> 02:54.840
You don't? Oh, okay. Hang on.

02:54.920 --> 02:57.160
Get out of the way, Top. Get out. Okay.

02:57.240 --> 03:00.280
-What'd you say?
-Do you two know each other?

03:00.360 --> 03:01.440
Uh…

03:01.520 --> 03:02.440
No. We still don't.

03:02.520 --> 03:04.840
Oh, you don't? You seem close though.

03:04.920 --> 03:06.080
Just now, when you were…

03:06.160 --> 03:07.760
-dancing.
-[laughing]

03:07.840 --> 03:08.680
[chuckles]

03:08.760 --> 03:10.880
So, what's your name?

03:12.240 --> 03:13.560
-Yes.
-Uh…

03:14.320 --> 03:15.920
Nanno. Uh-huh.

03:16.000 --> 03:17.200
Nanno?

03:17.280 --> 03:19.080
Hann and Nanno.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.360
You could be Hanno, right?

03:21.440 --> 03:23.040
Huh? Hanno, yeah?

03:23.120 --> 03:25.680
Hanno.

03:25.760 --> 03:26.920
[awkward laugh]

03:27.000 --> 03:28.920
Move closer. Closer, please.

03:29.600 --> 03:30.600
[laughs softly]

03:30.680 --> 03:32.560
Big smile for the camera.

03:33.120 --> 03:34.200
Can you do this?

03:34.280 --> 03:35.480
Closer.

03:35.560 --> 03:37.440
Put your hands together.

03:37.520 --> 03:38.360
Okay.

03:38.440 --> 03:41.480
Smile. Say Hanno together.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.000
One, two, three.

03:43.080 --> 03:44.160
-Hanno.
-Hanno.

03:46.000 --> 03:49.280
-[click]
-HANNO: OUR NEW FAIRYTALE COUPLE

03:53.440 --> 03:56.560
-[popping]
-OMG! THE FAIRYTALE COUPLE OF THE YEAR.

03:56.640 --> 03:59.640
HANNO ARE SO CUTE.

03:59.720 --> 04:03.520
SO CUTE! SCREAM

04:03.600 --> 04:08.840
AW. MINI-HEART!

04:14.080 --> 04:16.720
SOMEBODY IS JEALOUS.

04:16.800 --> 04:19.200
WHAT A MOOD SPOILER.

04:19.279 --> 04:22.280
GO AWAY IF YOU DON'T LIKE IT!

04:23.200 --> 04:24.240
[drums banging]

04:24.320 --> 04:26.760
[marching band playing]

04:56.080 --> 04:57.480
-[teacher] Hann.
-[cymbals clanging]

04:59.560 --> 05:01.720
-Yeah?
-What are you doing?

05:01.800 --> 05:03.880
You're chatting with Nanno, aren't you?

05:03.960 --> 05:06.400
[students teasing]

05:06.480 --> 05:08.240
-I…
-I'll let you send one message.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.520
You should focus.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.360
All right. Back to practice.

05:11.440 --> 05:14.320
[band playing]

05:36.560 --> 05:37.760
Been here long?

05:39.280 --> 05:40.560
I'm sorry, babe.

05:41.600 --> 05:43.640
I just can't avoid all of my fans.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.840
-It's a real burden.
-Wow.

05:46.520 --> 05:48.280
So, what? Are you that popular?

05:48.360 --> 05:49.600
I really am.

05:50.080 --> 05:51.320
[smooches] Hmm?

05:51.400 --> 05:52.680
-Hey.
-Hmm?

05:52.760 --> 05:54.600
Should I tell Jer for you then?

05:54.680 --> 05:56.640
I'll tell him to drop this…

05:56.720 --> 05:58.160
Hann and Nanno thing.

05:58.640 --> 05:59.880
Come on.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.120
No way.

06:01.200 --> 06:02.720
Then all the likes will disappear.

06:03.720 --> 06:05.000
Hmm.

06:05.080 --> 06:07.280
You're more interested in likes?

06:07.360 --> 06:08.840
That is true.

06:08.920 --> 06:09.800
Yeah?

06:09.880 --> 06:11.720
[chuckling] I'm joking.

06:11.800 --> 06:13.320
-Yeah.
-Hey.

06:13.840 --> 06:15.920
I'm joking,

06:16.480 --> 06:17.640
Seriously, though.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.520
What's the big deal?

06:19.600 --> 06:22.080
You like that I have lots of fans.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.200
Don't…

06:23.280 --> 06:24.880
You kinda feel like you should be…

06:24.960 --> 06:26.320
I don't know, maybe,

06:26.800 --> 06:27.840
be happy?

06:27.920 --> 06:29.120
Yeah?

06:29.200 --> 06:31.760
I might have felt that before but…

06:31.840 --> 06:33.720
with Nanno, it's not the case.

06:33.800 --> 06:34.960
This is weird.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.280
How is it weird?

06:36.760 --> 06:38.080
It's not weird at all.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.160
It's a modern fairytale.

06:41.720 --> 06:43.040
You're my soulmate,

06:43.120 --> 06:44.840
and the one who loves me.

06:45.440 --> 06:46.280
The most.

06:46.360 --> 06:47.760
Yui, okay?

06:47.840 --> 06:49.600
[humming, chuckling]

06:49.680 --> 06:51.080
Yeah…

06:51.640 --> 06:52.680
You like it?

06:53.440 --> 06:55.320
I've never failed a bet.

06:55.400 --> 06:56.840
I'm joking. Joking.
[chuckles]

06:56.920 --> 06:58.400
Promise me you'll…

06:58.960 --> 07:00.960
stay away from Nanno. Right?

07:01.720 --> 07:03.280
Nothing will happen.

07:05.640 --> 07:06.720
Okay.

07:08.560 --> 07:10.080
Promise me then.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.600
I love you.

07:14.800 --> 07:16.200
Come here.

07:16.280 --> 07:17.280
[phone buzzing]

07:17.360 --> 07:18.520
Hold on.

07:25.640 --> 07:27.440
Be right back.
[clears throat]

07:29.320 --> 07:31.560
-[Jer] I'm over here.
-[female student] Oh, speed up.

07:32.360 --> 07:33.960
[Hann] Hey. What happened?

07:34.480 --> 07:35.680
[Jer] Nanno disappeared.

07:35.760 --> 07:36.680
-Huh?
-[Jer] Okay, okay.

07:36.760 --> 07:38.640
-Let's, let's think.
-[Hann] What should we do?

07:38.720 --> 07:40.720
-Let's look around.
-[Hann] Okay.

07:40.800 --> 07:41.640
-Split up.
-Okay.

07:41.720 --> 07:43.000
-Sounds good.
-Let's go.

07:46.160 --> 07:48.440
[Jer] Today, Nanno has disappeared.

07:48.520 --> 07:50.160
-We're looking for her.
-[Hann] Nanno!

07:50.640 --> 07:52.640
Please send us your support.

07:52.720 --> 07:54.400
-Oh, shit.
-Did you check in the library?

07:54.480 --> 07:56.160
[male student] No.

07:56.240 --> 07:58.400
-[Nanno] Help me! Help!
-Hey!

07:59.120 --> 08:00.640
Hey, hey.

08:00.720 --> 08:02.040
-Nanno?
-Somebody, help!

08:02.120 --> 08:03.480
Hey, Nanno! Shit!

08:03.560 --> 08:04.760
-Oh! What the hell?
-Help me.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.560
-It's slippery.
-Watch out!

08:07.600 --> 08:09.640
-Help me! I'm in here.
-Nanno?

08:09.720 --> 08:11.520
-Kick it open!
-Go on!

08:11.600 --> 08:13.560
-Kick it in!
-Kick it in!

08:13.640 --> 08:15.120
[grunts] Ow!

08:15.200 --> 08:16.160
That hurts. Shit.

08:16.240 --> 08:17.480
Kick it harder!

08:17.560 --> 08:18.600
-[chattering]
-Damn!

08:18.680 --> 08:19.520
[Jer] That's good.

08:19.600 --> 08:20.960
-Nanno! [grunts]
-[Jer] Yes!

08:21.040 --> 08:23.360
That's a good shove. Woo!

08:24.480 --> 08:25.360
Out of the way!

08:25.440 --> 08:27.280
-Out of the way!
-[Hann] Watch out please.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.800
[Hann] Give us some room.

08:28.880 --> 08:30.200
[Jer] Please let us through.

08:30.280 --> 08:31.800
-[shoes squeaking]
-She fainted.

08:32.400 --> 08:33.520
[sighing]

08:35.039 --> 08:36.039
Nanno.

08:36.120 --> 08:37.559
-[girl giggling]
-Nanno.

08:38.120 --> 08:39.080
Nanno.

08:39.880 --> 08:41.200
[sighing]

08:41.280 --> 08:42.559
[cheering]

08:42.640 --> 08:44.640
[Jer] They're hugging. Oh wow.

08:44.720 --> 08:47.640
Nanno must be so grateful for Hann's help.

08:47.720 --> 08:49.040
[laughing]

08:49.680 --> 08:50.640
You're okay now.

08:50.720 --> 08:54.000
-Kiss her!
-Kiss her!

08:54.080 --> 08:55.200
[Top] Bang her!

08:58.200 --> 08:59.520
Oh.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.160
[Nanno clears throat]

09:03.600 --> 09:04.880
I'm sorry.

09:05.480 --> 09:07.800
I'm just so glad you were there
to rescue me.

09:07.880 --> 09:10.280
[chuckles] It's no problem at all.

09:10.360 --> 09:12.600
[teasing]

09:12.680 --> 09:13.880
Hey.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.840
Your hands are shaking like crazy.

09:15.920 --> 09:17.400
I'm still a little scared.

09:18.120 --> 09:20.680
There's just so much going on in my mind.

09:20.760 --> 09:22.160
[female student 1] Get her already.

09:22.240 --> 09:24.880
[female student 2] Why don't you
hold her hands and soothe her, Hann?

09:25.480 --> 09:27.560
-Hold her hands!
-Hold her hands!

09:27.640 --> 09:28.920
-[chattering]
-Hold her hands.

09:29.000 --> 09:30.560
-Come on everyone.
-Hold her hands!

09:30.640 --> 09:31.480
We're not a couple.

09:31.560 --> 09:33.400
-We should keep our distance.
-Get together.

09:33.480 --> 09:34.640
-[Jer] What?
-[groans]

09:34.720 --> 09:37.000
You're not together? You should be now.

09:37.080 --> 09:38.920
[teasing]

09:39.000 --> 09:40.960
-[Jer] You're perfect for each other.
-Stop it.

09:41.040 --> 09:42.440
Stop it. Come on, everyone.

09:42.520 --> 09:43.920
You know she's taken.

09:44.640 --> 09:45.800
Actually, I'm not.

09:45.880 --> 09:48.160
-Whoa. She's not.
-[students giggling]

09:48.960 --> 09:50.960
Do you have a girlfriend, Hann?

09:55.480 --> 09:56.560
Uh…

09:57.240 --> 09:58.360
No. I'm single.

09:58.440 --> 10:01.240
[students cheering]

10:01.920 --> 10:04.520
[Top] Why don't you
just date each other then?

10:04.600 --> 10:06.000
-Come on!
-Come on!

10:06.080 --> 10:08.360
-Kiss her.
-Hey.

10:08.440 --> 10:09.360
Become a couple.

10:09.440 --> 10:10.560
[Jer chuckling]

10:10.640 --> 10:11.840
No, we shouldn't.

10:11.920 --> 10:14.160
You're just putting Hann on the spot.

10:14.880 --> 10:17.640
I understand that this is
too good to be true.

10:17.720 --> 10:19.320
It just can't be.

10:22.720 --> 10:25.160
Thank you so much for rescuing me.

10:25.760 --> 10:27.560
I'm guess I'm gonna head out now.

10:28.640 --> 10:29.840
Stop.

10:30.360 --> 10:31.680
[students gasping]

10:34.560 --> 10:35.560
What?

10:37.800 --> 10:38.960
Will you date me?

10:39.040 --> 10:41.080
[excited screaming]

10:41.160 --> 10:42.960
[murmuring]

10:47.000 --> 10:49.600
[Nanno] All right. I would
love to be your girlfriend.

10:51.240 --> 10:52.080
However,

10:52.160 --> 10:53.960
I do have one condition.

10:55.240 --> 10:56.920
-[excited cries]
-What is that?

10:57.960 --> 10:59.720
As my boyfriend,

10:59.800 --> 11:01.640
you can't ever leave me.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.640
[students screaming]

11:03.720 --> 11:05.920
[laughing]

11:06.000 --> 11:09.360
-Hanno!
-Hanno!

11:14.920 --> 11:16.560
[clicking]

11:20.960 --> 11:22.440
Nanno is new to our school.

11:22.520 --> 11:24.000
Oh! She's a sweet girl,

11:24.080 --> 11:26.360
and I know she's very lively too.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.560
-She's nice.
-Yes, she's nice.

11:27.640 --> 11:29.200
-And friendly.
-She's adapting very well.

11:29.280 --> 11:30.760
Better than us even.

11:30.840 --> 11:32.480
We've been here since 7th grade,

11:32.560 --> 11:34.560
-but we still haven't settled in.
-[laughing]

11:34.640 --> 11:36.560
Everyone knows that these two
are a couple,

11:36.640 --> 11:38.280
so if they are showing PDA,

11:38.360 --> 11:39.440
it's pretty standard.

11:39.520 --> 11:40.360
[Jer] Hey, you two.

11:40.440 --> 11:42.320
Where you there when they got together?

11:42.400 --> 11:43.280
-Uh-huh.
-Yeah.

11:43.360 --> 11:45.480
-We can go inside, right?
-[giggling]

11:45.560 --> 11:46.640
Right here.

11:49.360 --> 11:51.000
If they're really a couple,

11:51.080 --> 11:52.600
I would like to offer this poem

11:52.680 --> 11:53.800
to Hann and Nanno.

11:53.880 --> 11:55.480
"Nanno, the new girl,

11:55.560 --> 11:58.480
so beautiful and lively at first glance.

11:59.280 --> 12:01.200
Hann then finally is going to ask her out

12:01.280 --> 12:03.680
in the hope of finding true love."

12:03.760 --> 12:06.040
Well, I'm happy for her because…

12:06.120 --> 12:08.200
she has Hann all to herself.

12:08.280 --> 12:09.120
You know?

12:09.200 --> 12:11.240
I want him for myself.
[laughing]

12:11.320 --> 12:13.040
But Hann and Nanno are a perfect couple.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.560
They're going to last until eternity.

12:14.640 --> 12:15.880
I think he's so hot.

12:15.960 --> 12:16.960
"They are…

12:17.040 --> 12:19.160
the perfect couple in every single way.

12:19.240 --> 12:21.240
There's is an eternal love.

12:21.320 --> 12:23.480
May their souls never part.

12:23.560 --> 12:26.680
May their love live on in their hearts."

12:26.760 --> 12:28.440
-[Jer] Yeah.
-Hmm?

12:28.520 --> 12:30.320
Hey there, Hann. Listen.

12:30.400 --> 12:33.520
You promised that
you will love Nanno forever.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.640
-Mm.
-And ever.

12:35.720 --> 12:37.360
-[Jer] Hey there.
-Hey.

12:37.440 --> 12:40.000
These are Hanno fans.

12:40.080 --> 12:41.440
Look at this.

12:41.520 --> 12:44.360
There's a lot of merchandise
on sale today.

12:46.400 --> 12:47.480
Here's some pillows.

12:47.560 --> 12:49.640
Look how cute.

12:49.720 --> 12:51.680
Ooh.
[giggling]

12:51.760 --> 12:54.360
There are masks as well.
[chuckling]

12:54.440 --> 12:56.440
There are also paper fans.

12:56.520 --> 12:58.240
Hanno paper fans.

12:58.320 --> 13:00.560
Which one do you choose?
[chuckling]

13:01.880 --> 13:04.240
There's bottled water over there.

13:04.320 --> 13:06.440
Oh! Wow. Huh.

13:06.520 --> 13:08.200
-Hey there.
-Hello.

13:08.280 --> 13:09.920
What's your name
and what grade are you in?

13:10.000 --> 13:11.280
-I'm Game.
-What grade are you in?

13:11.360 --> 13:12.680
-Grade 10? Grade 12.
-I'm Grade 12.

13:12.760 --> 13:14.800
-[giggling]
-Hey. You look so young though. I'm sorry.

13:14.880 --> 13:16.160
What's the first rule

13:16.240 --> 13:18.720
-between Nanno and Hann?
-"Don't leave."

13:18.800 --> 13:19.920
Once you've bought the item,

13:20.000 --> 13:21.680
-you shouldn't…
-Leave it.

13:21.760 --> 13:24.000
Yes. Keep it safe.

13:24.080 --> 13:27.640
[students singing]

13:33.560 --> 13:35.040
-Let's dance.
-[laughing]

13:35.120 --> 13:37.120
[cheering]

13:42.160 --> 13:44.160
[ominous music]

13:49.640 --> 13:51.880
[clicking]

13:55.640 --> 13:57.760
[keypad clicking]

14:01.640 --> 14:04.080
THIS IS GETTING TOO MUCH.
HOW FAR ARE YOU GOING TO TAKE IT?

14:04.160 --> 14:10.640
IT'S ONLY FOR THE LIKES.
PEOPLE WILL FORGET ABOUT IT.

14:14.320 --> 14:19.760
DID YOU FORGET ABOUT OUR DATE?
I'M ALREADY HERE.

14:21.400 --> 14:23.360
[door opening]

14:23.840 --> 14:25.320
[Jer] Hello.

14:26.000 --> 14:28.280
-Hey.
-What are you up to?

14:28.360 --> 14:29.720
-[laughing]
-Yeah.

14:29.800 --> 14:31.280
What are you doing here?

14:32.560 --> 14:34.440
Well, I had a nightmare.

14:35.920 --> 14:37.240
And I…

14:37.320 --> 14:39.760
wanted to watch you sleep.
So I stopped by.

14:41.080 --> 14:42.200
Ah…

14:42.960 --> 14:44.400
Uh-huh.

14:46.760 --> 14:48.440
[laughing]

14:51.200 --> 14:53.280
[Jer] Brr-ring.

14:53.360 --> 14:54.280
Hello.

14:54.360 --> 14:57.000
-Hey.
-Here we are. Yay!

14:57.080 --> 14:58.240
Top, you're in the frame.

14:58.320 --> 14:59.320
Don't get in the frame.

14:59.400 --> 15:00.840
They're eating.

15:00.920 --> 15:02.880
Today I made…

15:03.400 --> 15:06.400
a lunchbox for my boyfriend Hann.

15:06.480 --> 15:08.440
-[Jer] What do you have?
-Ah, here.

15:08.520 --> 15:10.680
-Get a good shot.
-Let me zoom in.

15:10.760 --> 15:11.920
Oh! That's nice.

15:12.000 --> 15:14.480
There's a sticker. How cute.

15:16.200 --> 15:17.800
It looks delicious.

15:17.880 --> 15:19.520
[Nanno] Check out this one too.

15:19.600 --> 15:21.000
[Jer] Which one is your favorite?

15:21.080 --> 15:23.480
-Let's ask him which one.
-Mm-hmm.

15:24.360 --> 15:25.880
What kind of meat is this?

15:25.960 --> 15:26.880
It's a bit…

15:27.680 --> 15:30.000
-stringy.
-[Jer laughing]

15:30.080 --> 15:31.480
I'm not gonna say.

15:31.560 --> 15:33.480
A chef never reveals her secret.

15:33.560 --> 15:35.440
Ahh…

15:36.200 --> 15:38.920
[laughing]

15:39.000 --> 15:40.160
Is it good?

15:40.640 --> 15:42.520
-Yeah it's good.
-Okay.

15:42.600 --> 15:44.160
Make sure you eat it all.

15:44.240 --> 15:45.840
I put a lot of heart into it.

15:45.920 --> 15:48.720
I even woke up early
to cook it for you, you know.

15:48.800 --> 15:49.960
[chuckling]

15:50.720 --> 15:52.240
Do… do you want to eat some?

15:52.720 --> 15:54.920
No, thank you.They're all for you.

16:01.480 --> 16:03.480
[girl 2] Make sure you adjust it
to fit your eyes.

16:03.560 --> 16:05.960
[Jer] You guys in the masks,
look this way.

16:06.040 --> 16:07.520
[drumsticks tapping]

16:07.600 --> 16:10.600
♪ Hip, hip, hip, hippo ♪

16:10.680 --> 16:12.040
♪ Wow, it's huge ♪

16:12.120 --> 16:15.000
♪ It ambles ♪

16:15.080 --> 16:18.160
♪ La, la, la ♪

16:18.240 --> 16:19.760
♪ Hip, hip ♪

16:22.160 --> 16:23.880
♪ A giant roti ♪

16:23.960 --> 16:26.320
♪ With egg and milk ♪

16:26.400 --> 16:27.600
♪ A round roti ♪

16:27.680 --> 16:29.560
♪ With egg and milk ♪

16:29.640 --> 16:31.160
♪ A giant roti ♪

16:31.240 --> 16:33.240
♪ With egg and milk ♪

16:33.320 --> 16:34.680
♪ A round roti ♪

16:34.760 --> 16:36.680
♪ With milk and egg ♪

16:36.760 --> 16:40.200
♪ Egg ♪

16:40.280 --> 16:43.200
♪ Egg ♪

16:47.160 --> 16:49.120
[sighing]

16:57.400 --> 16:59.120
-Yui.
-No.

16:59.200 --> 17:01.640
-I had enough.
-What are you talking about?

17:01.720 --> 17:03.640
-Come on now.
-This is all too much.

17:03.720 --> 17:05.480
If you don't dump her, we're over.

17:05.560 --> 17:06.920
Just calm down, Yui.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.440
Don't forget
that this was all just an act.

17:10.839 --> 17:12.440
You're my real girlfriend.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.000
-That was a show.
-That was a show?

17:15.079 --> 17:17.480
What kind of show?
We don't spend any time together.

17:17.560 --> 17:19.440
And those dance moves you pulled.

17:19.520 --> 17:20.880
What next? You'll start making out?

17:20.960 --> 17:22.319
It won't come to that.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.839
That's just obscene.

17:23.920 --> 17:26.119
Keep your voice down
or they might hear us.

17:27.520 --> 17:29.200
Calm down, okay?

17:29.280 --> 17:30.360
You're the one for me.

17:30.440 --> 17:31.360
What else do you want?

17:31.440 --> 17:32.960
-I'm not playing here.
-Hey.

17:34.200 --> 17:35.520
What the hell, Yui?

17:35.600 --> 17:37.120
-I can't do this.
-What?

17:37.200 --> 17:39.000
You need to break up now.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.280
But…

17:42.360 --> 17:44.200
-the likes…
-What's the matter?

17:44.840 --> 17:46.320
Don't you care at all?

17:54.640 --> 17:56.160
Please calm down now.

17:56.680 --> 17:57.840
It's gonna be okay.

18:00.120 --> 18:01.320
Trust me.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.520
I'll break it off with her.

18:07.120 --> 18:08.360
In two days.

18:10.880 --> 18:12.200
Then I'll break it off.

18:12.720 --> 18:14.080
Just two days.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.320
-No way.
-Huh?

18:16.400 --> 18:18.160
You'll break your promise again.

18:19.920 --> 18:21.880
I promise I'll go through with it.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.440
Okay?

18:34.440 --> 18:36.240
Then please don't disappoint me.

18:42.200 --> 18:44.200
[Jer] Where is he?

18:44.280 --> 18:46.080
[all] ♪ Hey, hey, hey, hey ♪

18:46.160 --> 18:47.400
[Jer] What?

18:49.400 --> 18:50.440
Ah…

18:52.680 --> 18:54.880
What's going on here?

18:56.080 --> 18:57.320
[Nanno] Hann…

18:57.920 --> 19:00.280
and Yui?

19:00.760 --> 19:01.920
[Nanno sobs]

19:06.240 --> 19:08.760
-Um… Excuse me.
-[Jer] Hey, Nanno.

19:15.960 --> 19:16.880
Follow her.

19:17.360 --> 19:18.400
Follow her.

19:19.600 --> 19:20.960
-Hann.
-Quick! Go on.

19:24.120 --> 19:25.200
Nanno!

19:26.080 --> 19:27.280
Nanno!

19:29.760 --> 19:31.120
-Stop.
-Hey!

19:31.200 --> 19:32.720
Ah… I'm so sorry.

19:32.800 --> 19:33.760
So…

19:34.440 --> 19:36.960
Let's go after Nanno. Let's go, let's go.

19:38.760 --> 19:40.720
[chattering]

19:41.440 --> 19:43.760
[crying]

20:01.640 --> 20:03.760
Are you and Yui both…

20:05.520 --> 20:07.320
in love with each other?

20:11.520 --> 20:13.960
-Ah…
-Don't lie to me please.

20:15.200 --> 20:17.880
I saw you with her there.

20:17.960 --> 20:19.880
[crying]

20:23.880 --> 20:26.040
-I won't lie to you now then.
-[sobbing]

20:28.240 --> 20:29.240
Well…

20:31.120 --> 20:34.080
-We are in a relationship.
-[sobbing]

20:41.040 --> 20:42.160
[Hann sighs]

20:45.080 --> 20:47.200
[whimpering]

20:50.120 --> 20:51.280
Hey…

20:51.880 --> 20:53.080
Listen to me.

20:57.800 --> 20:58.840
I…

20:59.440 --> 21:01.400
wanted the Facebook likes.

21:04.960 --> 21:06.560
So I chose to…

21:07.200 --> 21:08.520
date you, Nanno.

21:11.760 --> 21:14.080
Without ever considering your feelings,

21:14.760 --> 21:16.000
or Yui's.

21:16.920 --> 21:19.280
[sobbing]

21:23.920 --> 21:26.000
-Since then, things have been…
-[laughing hysterically]

21:26.080 --> 21:26.960
Hey.

21:32.120 --> 21:33.520
[sighing]

21:34.280 --> 21:36.120
Do you really think I'm upset?

21:36.960 --> 21:39.200
Why the hell would I be upset?

21:39.800 --> 21:41.800
I've known about you

21:41.880 --> 21:43.960
since my first day here.

21:44.480 --> 21:46.880
I've known what you really wanted.

21:48.320 --> 21:50.400
You wanted to be popular,

21:50.480 --> 21:53.080
and make the school your playground.

21:54.680 --> 21:56.320
So I helped you out, you know?

21:56.800 --> 21:58.080
Am I right?

22:03.200 --> 22:04.320
Okay.

22:04.400 --> 22:05.480
Then…

22:06.520 --> 22:08.400
-Why don't we go ahead and break up?
-No.

22:12.640 --> 22:14.880
You can't break up with me, remember?

22:15.840 --> 22:17.280
If we break up,

22:17.800 --> 22:19.880
I'll tell them all.

22:20.560 --> 22:24.360
That you broke my heart.
[sobbing]

22:26.800 --> 22:27.840
Yui,

22:28.320 --> 22:31.000
ruined everything that we had.

22:31.080 --> 22:33.240
She destroyed us.

22:36.560 --> 22:38.840
Yui is so cruel.

22:38.920 --> 22:40.800
Oh, what about this?

22:41.560 --> 22:42.680
Hann…

22:43.320 --> 22:45.840
Hann is a total liar.

22:46.440 --> 22:49.120
He told me he wouldn't leave me.

22:50.480 --> 22:51.880
But in the end,

22:53.200 --> 22:55.600
he broke the promise.

22:55.680 --> 22:58.360
[sobbing, laughing hysterically]

22:58.960 --> 23:01.240
It doesn't matter at all what I say.

23:01.320 --> 23:03.160
Your popularity…

23:03.920 --> 23:05.680
is done for.

23:07.680 --> 23:08.720
Nanno?

23:08.800 --> 23:09.920
Yeah?

23:10.720 --> 23:12.800
Are you regretting things?

23:15.240 --> 23:16.640
I guess you do.

23:16.720 --> 23:18.720
I wonder what you'll do next.

23:22.600 --> 23:25.120
Good luck with that, Hann.

23:25.200 --> 23:26.840
[laughs menacingly]

23:28.880 --> 23:30.400
HANNO

23:30.480 --> 23:33.760
COMPETITION OPEN
FOR NEW HANNO STICKER DESIGN

23:33.840 --> 23:35.360
HERE'S THE FIRST ONE
LOWKEY SLUTTY

23:35.440 --> 23:36.440
WHAT GHOST IS THIS?

23:37.560 --> 23:38.400
I WANT CHICKEN!

23:38.480 --> 23:40.720
WHO PUT THE SALT IN THE HOLE?

23:41.320 --> 23:43.480
[clicking]

23:45.760 --> 23:47.400
[keypad clicking]

23:48.920 --> 23:51.320
[Jer] Attention please, attention please.

23:51.400 --> 23:54.520
Students who ordered
the new Hanno mask,

23:54.600 --> 23:59.320
please pick them up in front
of the cafeteria tomorrow morning.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.800
The masks are coming, everyone.

24:03.880 --> 24:05.480
Yay!
[chuckles]

24:08.080 --> 24:10.160
To all the Hanno fan clubs,

24:10.240 --> 24:13.600
I wanna dedicate this song to you.

24:13.680 --> 24:16.760
-[keypad clicking]
-[music playing over speaker]

24:23.160 --> 24:25.160
I'M SCREWED, TOO.
I GOT PLAYED BY NANNO.

24:25.240 --> 24:28.880
YUI: IF SHE REFUSES TO BREAK UP,
GET THE OTHERS TO PRESSURE HER.

24:28.960 --> 24:30.600
HOW?

24:34.520 --> 24:35.840
[male player 1] Pass it over here.

24:35.920 --> 24:37.120
Hey. Come on.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.560
Pass it. Pass it.

24:42.280 --> 24:44.400
[Yui] It looks like flirting, right?

24:44.480 --> 24:45.800
[Hann] It's too far away.

24:45.880 --> 24:48.040
[Yui] The crickets are too loud.

24:48.120 --> 24:49.320
[Hann] Still too far.

24:52.960 --> 24:54.040
[Hann] Yeah.

24:54.120 --> 24:55.800
-[Yui] See?
-Hmm.

24:55.880 --> 24:57.840
-That's more like it.
-Mm-hmm.

24:59.080 --> 25:00.760
-Is this okay?
-It's not bad.

25:01.480 --> 25:04.000
-This shot is okay.
-Yeah.

25:04.080 --> 25:05.240
Here.

25:07.160 --> 25:08.440
Zoom in a bit.

25:08.920 --> 25:09.960
Huh?

25:10.440 --> 25:11.360
Hmm.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.240
[ripping]

25:41.880 --> 25:43.320
[footsteps approaching]

25:43.960 --> 25:45.240
[gates creaking]

25:47.480 --> 25:49.680
-[camera clicking]
-Stop that.

25:49.760 --> 25:51.560
-[murmuring]
-[camera clicking]

25:51.640 --> 25:52.840
-Stop that.
-What are you doing?

25:52.920 --> 25:54.720
-Stop that.
-What are you doing?

25:54.800 --> 25:56.600
What are you doing? Stop.

25:56.680 --> 25:58.920
-Stop that.
-Stop that!

25:59.000 --> 26:01.160
[cameras clicking]

26:39.480 --> 26:40.880
[falling utensils clanging]

26:46.880 --> 26:48.920
Has everyone lost their minds?

26:52.440 --> 26:54.040
-I won't deal with this.
-[thumps]

26:54.120 --> 26:56.440
[plates crashing]

26:57.680 --> 27:02.680
[students chanting] Hanno!

27:02.760 --> 27:07.920
-Hanno!
-Hanno!

27:08.000 --> 27:10.160
[water splashing]

27:32.280 --> 27:33.120
[splats]

27:37.880 --> 27:39.320
Give me her number.

27:42.520 --> 27:48.360
DO NOT LEAVE THE SCHOOL PREMISES

27:53.480 --> 27:56.960
[gate opening]

28:26.160 --> 28:27.960
[gate closing]

28:34.160 --> 28:35.200
What's happening?

28:36.440 --> 28:37.560
Hann!

28:38.880 --> 28:40.000
-[slap]
-Huh!

28:40.080 --> 28:41.520
[thuds]

29:18.320 --> 29:19.560
If she died,

29:25.080 --> 29:26.440
I'd pretend…

29:27.440 --> 29:28.800
to be sad.

29:33.120 --> 29:35.240
Then this would finally be over.

29:47.760 --> 29:52.960
MEET ME AT THE ROOFTOP. COME ALONE.
HANDSOME HANN

29:53.520 --> 29:55.560
-[paper rustling]
-[footsteps]

30:12.480 --> 30:14.560
-[Yui grunts]
-[Nanno thuds]

30:14.640 --> 30:16.400
[wooden pole clatters]

30:18.560 --> 30:20.680
[indistinct chatter]

30:21.280 --> 30:22.480
[loud thud]

30:28.760 --> 30:30.960
[students screaming]

30:31.040 --> 30:33.440
-Oh my god!
-Oh, god. No!

30:35.240 --> 30:37.040
[Hann] Excuse me! Excuse me!

30:38.480 --> 30:39.360
Oh!

30:39.440 --> 30:40.280
Nanno!

30:41.200 --> 30:43.120
Nanno! Nanno!

30:43.200 --> 30:44.520
[panting]

30:46.480 --> 30:47.800
[grunting]

30:50.280 --> 30:52.000
What happened?

30:52.480 --> 30:53.440
Nan…

30:53.520 --> 30:54.600
Ambulance!

30:55.200 --> 30:57.520
Come on. Somebody call an ambulance!
Come on.

30:57.600 --> 30:59.360
-What?
-[indistinct chatter]

30:59.440 --> 31:01.840
[crying]

31:05.840 --> 31:08.640
-Why did you do this?
-[girls crying]

31:08.720 --> 31:09.800
Nanno!

31:15.080 --> 31:16.160
I'm so bad.

31:17.600 --> 31:18.960
[sobbing]
I'm a bad guy.

31:19.480 --> 31:21.400
-What's done is done.
-It's okay.

31:31.840 --> 31:34.760
[eerie music]

31:47.760 --> 31:50.400
[eerie music continues]

32:22.840 --> 32:24.160
[intermittent static]

32:26.760 --> 32:28.200
[intermittent static]

32:30.840 --> 32:32.800
[ominous music]

32:39.680 --> 32:41.480
-[door opens]
-[footsteps]

32:42.360 --> 32:43.200
Yui.

32:44.360 --> 32:45.760
It's over now. You did it.

32:49.560 --> 32:50.520
No.

32:51.200 --> 32:52.400
I didn't.

32:56.400 --> 32:57.560
What do you mean?

33:03.320 --> 33:04.400
Never mind.

33:04.480 --> 33:05.960
She's out of…

33:06.560 --> 33:08.400
the picture now. Isn't she?

33:09.680 --> 33:11.200
-Isn't she?
-Yeah.

33:11.280 --> 33:12.240
[chuckling]

33:12.320 --> 33:13.480
Yeah.

33:13.560 --> 33:15.320
I'm so happy.

33:15.920 --> 33:17.200
I feel like…

33:20.760 --> 33:22.760
I've been reborn.

33:22.840 --> 33:25.160
[relieved sigh]

33:25.920 --> 33:26.960
Hann.

33:27.960 --> 33:29.720
We need to stick to the plan.

33:31.600 --> 33:33.720
Put on a sad face for now.

33:33.800 --> 33:35.920
Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.

33:36.840 --> 33:38.000
Then I will…

33:38.560 --> 33:40.160
ordain as a nun for her.

33:41.560 --> 33:42.560
[phone vibrates]

33:55.960 --> 33:58.560
[eerie music]

34:00.640 --> 34:03.920
[footsteps approaching]

34:19.320 --> 34:22.280
Although the patient
was successfully resuscitated,

34:22.360 --> 34:25.080
she will remain vegetative
for the rest of her life.

34:25.679 --> 34:29.159
Is anyone willing
to take care of her forever?

34:32.560 --> 34:34.000
[female student 1] Him. This is Hann.

34:34.080 --> 34:35.480
Nanno's boyfriend.

34:35.560 --> 34:37.800
[female student 2] Yeah he is.
They're in love.

34:38.719 --> 34:40.120
Well, he promised.

34:44.600 --> 34:48.440
[students chanting] Forever and ever.

34:48.520 --> 34:53.600
-Forever and ever.
-Forever and ever.

34:54.080 --> 34:59.360
-Forever and ever.
-Forever and ever.

35:00.600 --> 35:02.160
-Forever and ever.
-Forever and ever.

35:05.480 --> 35:08.280
[students chanting] As my boyfriend,

35:08.360 --> 35:12.480
the first rule is,
"Don't you ever leave me."

35:13.040 --> 35:16.840
The second rule is also not to leave me.

35:17.440 --> 35:21.520
The third rule is still the same.

35:22.080 --> 35:27.240
-Hanno.
-Hanno.

35:27.920 --> 35:31.320
-Hanno.
-Hanno.

35:31.960 --> 35:35.360
-Hanno.
-Hanno.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.960
Hanno.

35:38.640 --> 35:40.240
Hanno.

35:41.040 --> 35:42.760
Hanno.

35:43.360 --> 35:44.360
Thank you…

35:44.440 --> 35:47.040
so much for letting me…

35:47.120 --> 35:48.960
be with my Hann forever.

35:49.720 --> 35:50.720
Hanno.

35:52.000 --> 35:53.040
[Yui gasps]

35:53.120 --> 35:55.200
[pensive music]

37:04.480 --> 37:06.480
Subtitle translation by
Supanida Hompoonsup
